  "name": "Technology Park ABM",
  "description": "Reproducible agent-based model of a technology park that studies when interactions among startups, anchor firms, universities, investors, workers, and park governance generate increasing returns. Deterministic under a supplied seed; no network calls in the model; investigation workbench with seeded execution and synthesis verdicts; experiment runners (E1-E7); Morris/Sobol global sensitivity analysis; pattern-oriented validation; validated public-data pipeline.",
